    pharm: "1. No specific antiviral therapy indicated for acute HBV in immunocompetent adults (spontaneous clearance rate 95%). 2. Supportive care: IV fluids if dehydrated, Antiemetics (Ondansetron 4mg IV PRN if no prolonged QT), avoid hepatotoxic drugs (paracetamol max 2g/day, no NSAIDs). 3. Consider Tenofovir Disoproxil Fumarate 300mg daily if: severe/fulminant hepatitis (INR >1.5, encephalopathy) or prolonged course (>4 weeks with persistent high ALT). 4. Vitamin K 10mg IV if INR elevated.",
